    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39402" root="نجد" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْجُودٌ</span></b>  <i>Overcome; conquered; subdued; overpowered:</i> and <i>fatigued.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْجُودٌ</span> and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيدٌ</span></b>  (and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجُودٌ</span></b>  applied to a female, R,)
<i>Afflicted, distressed,</i> or <i>oppressed, by sorrow,
grief</i> or <i>anxiety.</i> (S, L, K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِدٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْجُودٌ</span> <i>In a state of perishing</i> or <i>destruction.</i>
(L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاجِدٌ</span>.

